  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien retro boogie-funk in the laid-back, lazy 1980s style. Rubbery Minimoog synth bass playing octave-jumping sixteenth lines; Linn-style drum machine with a dry snare and live hand claps on two and four; clavinet stabs; chorused clean electric guitar doing choppy sixteenth-note rhythm. Dry, tight 1980s mix with no reverb wash. A relaxed male baritone, half-spoken and wry in the verses, with a group shout on the chorus. 108 BPM, E minor. Sweaty, sheepish and laughing at itself. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drop, no rap verse, no slick modern R&B.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n透早六點 溪仔邊的公園\n三十個阿姨 排甲整整齊齊\n我穿運動褲 徛佇上尾後\n教練一下喝 音樂就起來\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n倒手 正手 閣踏兩步\n我的跤 毋知欲踏佗位\n\n[Chorus]\n跳有氧 跳有氧\n人攏向正爿 我向倒爿\n汗流甲 衫仔澹漉漉\n跳有氧 阿姨笑甲咍咍\n\n[Verse]\n隔壁的阿桃姨 共我搝一下\n少年仔 目睭看我的跤就好\n我講 阿姨 我五十矣\n伊講 佇遮 你上少年\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n倒手 正手 閣踅一輾\n這擺 我總算綴會著\n\n[Chorus]\n跳有氧 跳有氧\n人攏向正爿 我嘛向正爿\n汗流甲 衫仔澹漉漉\n跳有氧 阿姨共我拍噗仔\n\n[Bridge]\n明仔載 我閣來\n徛較頭前 一屑仔\n\n[Chorus]\n跳有氧 跳有氧\n音樂一下停 大家攏咧喘\n汗流甲 衫仔澹漉漉\n跳有氧 我嘛笑甲咍咍\n\n[Outro]\n阿姨 明仔載見",
